      "id": "bug-025",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T00:00:00Z",
      "error_message": "Validator blocks questions where VLM emits 'A)' as correct_option_label — 'A)' not in ('A','B','C','D')",
      "file": "backend/app/routers/ingest.py",
      "root_cause": "VLMs (granite3.2-vision, qwen-vl family) frequently output answer labels with trailing parentheses ('A)', 'B.') or lowercase ('a'). _normalize_extracted_questions passed labels through verbatim, causing every such question to fail the blocking validator check.",
      "fix": "Added _clean_option_label() helper and applied it in _normalize_extracted_questions to both correct_option_label and each option's label field. Strips trailing ')' and '.', uppercases.",
      "tags": [
        "normalization",
        "validator",
        "vlm",
        "option-label",
        "ingest"
      ],
      "related_bugs": [],
      "occurrences": 1,
      "last_seen": "2026-05-11"
    },
    {
      "id": "bug-026",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-11T00:00:00Z",
      "error_message": "VLM (granite3.2-vision) outputs duplicate question rows — Q2-Q4 all identical to Q2",
      "file": "backend/app/routers/ingest.py",
      "root_cause": "Small VLMs hallucinate repeated question objects in their JSON output. _normalize_extracted_questions had no deduplication, so all duplicates were persisted as separate Question rows.",
      "fix": "Added seen_texts set in _normalize_extracted_questions; questions with identical question_text (case-insensitive, stripped) are skipped after the first occurrence.",
      "tags": [
        "deduplication",
        "vlm",
        "hallucination",
